OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Peggy Seeger - A Life  
OL,13,G     in Music                          
OL,14,     FFor most of her life Peggy Seeger 
OL,15,     Fwrote songs about the outside     
OL,16,     Fworld. She tells Kate Molleson why
OL,17,     Fthe love songs came only in her   
OL,18,     Ffifties, when she fell for Irene  
OL,19,     FScott.                            
